# Code
```java []
class Solution {
    public int stoneGameVIII(int[] stones) {
        int n = stones.length;
        int[] prefix = new int[n+1];
        for(int i = 0;i<n;i++)
        {
            prefix[i+1] = prefix[i]+stones[i];
        }
        int max = prefix[n];
        for(int j = n-2;j>0;j--)
        {
            max = Math.max(max,prefix[j+1] - max);
        }
        return max;
    }
}
```
